# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpiler"
msgstr "Transpiler"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpiler {#transpiler}"
msgstr "Transpilador {#transpiler}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") function is a flexible and convenient tool to build a [`qiskit.transpiler.PassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.PassManager) that can group the circuit instructions into annotated boxes. This gives an easy alternative to manually grouping and annotating circuits, and is useful for automating a workflow, testing different circuit boxing strategies, and so on.\n"
msgstr "La función [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") es una herramienta flexible y práctica para construir un [`qiskit.transpiler.PassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.PassManager) que puede agrupar las instrucciones del circuito en boxes anotados. Esto ofrece una alternativa sencilla a agrupar y anotar manualmente los circuitos, y resulta útil para automatizar un flujo de trabajo, probar distintas estrategias de agrupación de circuitos en boxes, etc.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide illustrates how to use [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") and its arguments. To highlight the effects of each of the function’s arguments, the following sections mainly refer to the circuit below.\n"
msgstr "Esta guía ilustra cómo usar [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") y sus argumentos. Para destacar los efectos de cada uno de los argumentos de la función, las secciones siguientes se refieren principalmente al circuito que aparece a continuación.\n"

