#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/cdf089891dabe1650f1303c8c747aa8cf03cdde4dfc42c772fe2264bd7a49a1b.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/cdf089891dabe1650f1303c8c747aa8cf03cdde4dfc42c772fe2264bd7a49a1b.avif)\n"
