#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/172fa55c9f02964fef32fc045a50b86971126be728602b3f1e4b2437df2580b7.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/172fa55c9f02964fef32fc045a50b86971126be728602b3f1e4b2437df2580b7.avif)\n"
